      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;font-family:Arial">A practical direction</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;font-family:Arial">Green Pulse turns broad sustainability goals into local experiments that people can see, use and improve.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;font-family:Arial">Each program begins with a real need and a clear owner.</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 34ed4bcd7808455d5d0d8346ee42ed6bc4beb90d5c3beab60a38846766982fd4
  - elementId: slide-8-node-135-intro-b
    elementType: text
    bounds:
      - 215
      - 338
      - 165
      - 155
    content:
