      color: '#FFFFFF'
      align:
        - left
        - top
      wrap: true
      text: <p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;font-family:Arial">From idea to evidence</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;font-family:Arial">Teams build a small pilot, invite feedback and record the result before deciding whether to repeat, revise or stop.</span></p><p></p><p><span style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:11px;font-family:Arial">The reporting rhythm follows the work.</span></p>
    sourceLayout: 3c1ed636074ab92ec63ea83daced63da04f771c7380f75ab952cdfbcc6f8b033
